::  modules/aurora/glow/gate-riscv-hart-boot.glow -- RV64GC Glasswall!
/!  16384
|%
++  gate-riscv-hart-boot
  |=  [nvme-present=@ud spi-wp=@ud dram-mib=@ud]        ::  Blazepod pins
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  0x5555 = PASS
  ~|  'blazepod-nvme-present-in-ram-mode'               ::  tally-ram law!
  ?>  (eql nvme-present 0)                              ::  zero disk residue
  ~|  'blazepod-spi-wp-unasserted'                      ::  immutable ROM!
  ?>  (eql spi-wp 1)                                    ::  /WP jumper closed
  ~|  'blazepod-dram-below-4gib'                        ::  4 GiB LPDDR5 min
  ?>  (gte dram-mib 4096)
  21.845                                                ::  0x5555 sifive ok
--
